        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn WP1BP, Warwick Rough Iron Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis warwick rough iron door pull will compliment any outdoor area. This old world designed piece is most often used on garden gates or barn doors; but it would work well on any lightweight door. Made by Acorn, the WP1BP Warwick 10-7/8\" Handle has a rough iron finish that duplicates the ironwork of many old European castles and cathedrals and imitates naturally weathered of iron.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/warwick-9-inch-rough-iron-door-pull-acorn-wp2bp\"><b>9 inch Warwick Door Pull</b></a>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<b>\r\nSpecifications</b> for the Acorn Warwick Door Pull:\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Rough Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Length: 10-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime No-Rust Warranty!</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually. Package includes 1 pull and hardware for a surface mounted application.</i>\r\n</p>",
